    "abstract": "The problem of comparing the variability of two populations in the presence of fuzzy data is considered. We show that applying the modified band depth to specifically transformed membership functions,\ncombined with a permutation procedure, leads us to construct a new interesting test for dispersion.",
    "keywords": "functional data analysis, fuzzy data, fuzzy numbers, statistical depth, credibility distribution, test for dispersion"
